<title>AUSTRIA: MOTORCYCLING-AUSTRIAN GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-AUSTRIAN GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>ZELTWEG, Austria 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in</p>
<p>Friday's first official qualifying session for Sunday's 500cc</p>
<p>motorcycle Grand Prix (circuit length 4.318 kilometres, 2.683</p>
<p>miles):</p>
<p>1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda, one minute 29.654 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda		  1:29.801</p>
<p>  3. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda		    1:30.258</p>
<p>  4. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha		  1:30.785</p>
<p>  5. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda		   1:30.970</p>
<p>  6. Alberto Puig (Spain) Honda		    1:31.087</p>
<p>  7. Alex Criville (Spain) Honda		   1:31.136</p>
<p>  8. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda		    1:31.351</p>
<p>  9. Norifume Abe (Japan) Yamaha		   1:31.688</p>
<p> 10. Jean-Michel Bayle (France)  Modenas KR3   1:31.754</p>
</text>
